{"unit_id":"QuantumKuba__dsh-webstack#feature-1","repo":"QuantumKuba/dsh-webstack","commit":"459a2719aa1aaa5300130f0712bb201ca932ac8e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-webstack 的功能「search」：SearXNG 网页搜索：调用配置的 SearXNG `/search` JSON 接口，将查询作为 `q` 参数并把结果规范化为标题、摘要和链接。由 DSH 的 web 搜索请求触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/searxng/provider.ts:51-105","src/searxng/provider.ts:132-173"]}
